0159edpokl\u00e1d\u00e1 schopnost zavolat API dotaz a n\u00e1sledn\u011b zpracovat odpov\u011b\u010f ve form\u00e1tu JSON.\n\nZde na t\u00e9to str\u00e1nce naleznete popis v\u0161ech vol\u00e1n\u00ed a co vrac\u00ed. M\u016f\u017eete si tak\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edmo zde vol\u00e1n\u00ed API vyzkou\u0161et po kliknut\u00ed na tla\u010d\u00edtko \"Vyzkou\u0161et operaci\".\n\nPro vol\u00e1n\u00ed API je t\u0159eba m\u00edt vygenerovan\u00fd unik\u00e1tn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd kl\u00ed\u010d. Ten si m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b zm\u011bnit zde (a proklik na \"Kl\u00ed\u010d k API\").\n\nVol\u00e1n\u00ed API je omezeno n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edmi limity - ov\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1no pro ka\u017ed\u00e9ho u\u017eivatele a pro ka\u017ed\u00fd web:\n  * nejv\u00fd\u0161e 5 dotaz\u016f za vte\u0159inu\n  * a nejv\u00fd\u0161e 100 dotaz\u016f za minutu\n  * po\u017eadavek na vynucen\u00ed indexace str\u00e1nek je mo\u017eno d\u011blat nejv\u00fd\u0161e 500 kr\u00e1t za den\n","title":"Webmaster API","version":"0.1"},"parameters":{"key":{"description":"API kl\u00ed\u010d","in":"query","name":"key","required":true,"type":"string"}},"paths":{"/__healthcheck":{"get":{"description":"Pokud service be\u017e\u00ed vr\u00e1t\u00ed 200 OK","operationId":"wmt.api_public.handlers.get_healthcheck","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","schema":{"type":"string"}},"503":{"description":"service unavailable","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}}},"summary":"Healthcheck"}},"/database-info":{"get":{"description":"Vr\u00e1t\u00ed dostupn\u00e9 informace o datab\u00e1zi.","operationId":"wmt.api_public.handlers.get_database_info","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","schema":{"properties":{"release":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"}},"503":{"description":"datab\u00e1ze nen\u00ed dostupn\u00e1","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}}},"summary":"Informace o datab\u00e1zi"}},"/metrics":{"get":{"operationId":"wmt.api_public.handlers.get_metrics","responses":{"