9esm\u011brovan\u00fdch webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek\n  - **index**: po\u010det webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek v indexu\n  - **error**: po\u010det chybov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek\n","operationId":"wmt.api_public.handlers.get_webserver_documents","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/parameters/key"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/WebDocuments"}},"204":{"description":"dotaz prob\u011bhnul v po\u0159\u00e1dku, ale data zat\u00edm nejsou dostupn\u00e1","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}},"400":{"description":"v dotazu chyb\u00ed API kl\u00ed\u010d (parametr key)","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}},"401":{"description":"nespr\u00e1vn\u00fd API kl\u00ed\u010d","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}},"404":{"description":"data webu nenalezena","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}},"502":{"description":"slu\u017eba je mimo provoz","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}},"503":{"description":"slu\u017eba je mimo provoz","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ProblemResult"}}},"summary":"Po\u010dty a vzorky webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek"}},"/web/documents-history":{"get":{"description":"Vr\u00e1t\u00ed posloupnost po\u010dt\u016f webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek v \u010dase za jednotliv\u00e9 dny. Po\u010dty webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek jsou uv\u00e1d\u011bny v jednotliv\u00fdch kategori\u00edch:\n\n  - **error**: po\u010det chybov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek\n  - **doc_count**: po\u010det webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek, o jejich\u017e existenci robot v\u00ed\n  - **content**: po\u010det webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek, kter\u00e9 robot stahuje a zn\u00e1 jejich obsah\n  - **downloaded**: po\u010det webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek objeven\u00fdch robotem. Zastaral\u00e9, nahrazeno katergori\u00ed `doc_count`\n  - **redirected**: po\u010det p\u0159esm\u011brovan\u00fdch webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek\n  - **indexed**: po\u010det webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek v indexu\n","operationId":"wmt.api_public.handlers.get_webserver_documents_history","parame